  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Evaluate $f(-1,2)$ if $f(x,y)=(2x-y)(x+2y).$",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=-1$ and $y=2$ into the function definition and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =(2x-y)(x+2y) \\\\ f(-1,2) & =(2(-1)-2)((-1)+2(2)) \\\\  & =(-4)(3) \\\\  & =-12\\end{aligned}\n$$",
